## 📋 Execution Trace

Every query produces an auditable trace:

```json
{
  "task": "vqa",
  "selected_model": "rs_vqa_captioner",
  "inputs_summary": "1 image(s) [satellite.tif], config=single_optical",
  "confidence": 0.87,
  "latency_ms": 342.5,
  "timestamp": "2024-12-01T10:30:00Z",
  "status": "success"
}
```

